<section class="voc" id="backstory">
  <div class="section-head reveal">
    <span class="eyebrow" style="color:#ff7a44;">Backstory</span>
    <h2>
      <span style="color: var(--tier-low)">250</span> applications is normal now.<br
      /><span style="color: var(--text-dark-muted)"
        >The <span class="accent">stories</span> below say why.</span
      >
    </h2>
    <p>
      The reviews below are real complaints pulled from <span class="accent"
        >G2, Trustpilot, and Reddit</span
