      not in spite of them.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="review-grid">
    <div class="review pain reveal">
      <div class="q-mark">&ldquo;</div>
      <p>
        Applied to 100+ jobs using a Jobscan-optimized resume with high match
        rates. <em>Zero responses.</em>
      </p>
