      </p>
      <div class="q-attr">
        <div class="q-avatar q-avatar-src">
          <img
            src="https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=trustpilot.com&sz=64"
            alt="Trustpilot"
            loading="lazy"
            width="32"
            height="32"
          />
        </div>
        <div class="q-info">
          <div class="q-role">Software Engineer · Jr</div>
